  36:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c **** /**
  37:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****  * @brief Processing function for the Q15 DCT4/IDCT4.
  38:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *S             points to an instance of the Q15 DCT4 structure.
  39:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****  * @param[in]       *pState        points to state buffer.
  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****  * @param[in,out]   *pInlineBuffer points to the in-place input and output buffer.
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****  * @return none.
