  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****   /* DCT4 computation involves DCT2 (which is calculated using RFFT)
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lamp\AppData\Local\Temp\ccQ7RcWg.s 			page 3


  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * along with some pre-processing and post-processing.
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * Computational procedure is explained as follows:
  66:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * (a) Pre-processing involves multiplying input with cos factor,
  67:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *     r(n) = 2 * u(n) * cos(pi*(2*n+1)/(4*n))
  68:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *              where,
  69:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                 r(n) -- output of preprocessing
  70:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                 u(n) -- input to preprocessing(actual Source buffer)
  71:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * (b) Calculation of DCT2 using FFT is divided into three steps:
  72:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                  Step1: Re-ordering of even and odd elements of input.
  73:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                  Step2: Calculating FFT of the re-ordered input.
  74:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                  Step3: Taking the real part of the product of FFT output and weights.
  75:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * (c) Post-processing - DCT4 can be obtained from DCT2 output using the following equation:
  76:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                   Y4(k) = Y2(k) - Y4(k-1) and Y4(-1) = Y4(0)
  77:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                        where,
  78:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    *                           Y4 -- DCT4 output,   Y2 -- DCT2 output
  79:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    * (d) Multiplying the output with the normalizing factor sqrt(2/N).
  80:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****    */
  81:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c **** 
  82:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****         /*-------- Pre-processing ------------*/
  83:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****   /* Multiplying input with cos factor i.e. r(n) = 2 * x(n) * cos(pi*(2*n+1)/(4*n)) */
  84:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_q15.c ****   arm_mult_q15(pInlineBuffer, cosFact, pInlineBuffer, S->N);
